### Complete Microservices Integration Test Flow

### 1. Check Gateway Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Check All Services Health
GET http://localhost:8080/user-ms/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8080/marketplace-ms/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8080/payment-ms/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8080/transaction-ms/actuator/health

### 3. Create User (Internal)
POST http://localhost:8080/user-ms/users/internal/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Create Hotel Item
POST http://localhost:8080/marketplace-ms/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Hotel Test",
  "descripcion": "Hotel para testing",
  "categoria": "ALOJAMIENTO",
  "clasificacion": {
    "precio": 200.00,
    "ubicacion": "Test City",
    "serviciosIncluidos": ["WiFi", "Desayuno"],
    "capacidad": 2,
    "clasificacion": 4
  }
}

### 5. Add Item to Cart
POST http://localhost:8080/marketplace-ms/items/1/add-to-cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "test-user-123",
  "cantidad": 1,
  "precioUnitario": 200.00
}

### 6. List Cart Items
POST http://localhost:8080/transaction-ms/carrito-compra/list-items-carrito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "test-user-123"
}

### 7. Create Bank Client
POST http://localhost:8080/payment-ms/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { createClienteBanco(input: { nombreCompleto: \"Test User\", banco: \"Banco Test\", numeroCuenta: \"1111222233334444\", saldo: 5000.00, usuarioId: \"test-user-123\" }) { id nombreCompleto saldo } }"
}

### 8. Create Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transaction-ms/transaccion/create/test-user-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metodoPago": "TARJETA_CREDITO",
  "montoTotal": 200.00,
  "descripcion": "Reserva de hotel"
}

### 9. Create Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/payment-ms/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { createPago(input: { metodoPago: \"TARJETA_CREDITO\", monto: 200.00, usuarioId: \"test-user-123\" }) { id estado monto } }"
}

### 10. Process Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/transaction-ms/transaccion/process-payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaccionId": 1,
  "metodoPago": "TARJETA_CREDITO",
  "monto": 200.00,
  "datosAdicionales": {
    "numeroTarjeta": "1111222233334444",
    "codigoSeguridad": "123"
  }
}

### 11. Get User Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/transaction-ms/transaccion/list/test-user-123

### 12. Get User Payments
POST http://localhost:8080/payment-ms/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { pagosByUsuario(usuarioId: \"test-user-123\") { id metodoPago monto estado fechaPago } }"
}